// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1300536053" "The PPD actually managed to do something right today. Unfortunately I'm pretty sure their competence isn't going to hold out, so I want to use you as a bit of an insurance policy.<br><br>I need you to head over to Precinct 9 and make sure that the Resistance Cell leader they captured in a raid doesn't get sprung by his fellows."
