"P2272572159" "Resistance Leader Talks"
// DetailString :
"P4007791679" "The Resistance leader had the following to say.<br><br>You're too late, mind slave. Now that we've got the alien weapons too the playing field is even. Hah! They didn't even tell you what you were protecting, did they? Typical! You'd be wise to question who your superiors are really looking out for. I'll give you a hint, it ain't you or the populace!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1177301488" "A clockwork cleaner just signaled that Novahold Storage has been broken into. Unfortunately for the little metal fella, his signal got cut, and by the sound of it, it was from automatic powered weapon's fire, and that sounds like the Resistance to me.<br><br>{HeroName}, if the Resistance are raiding Novahold they're doing it for a reason."
// SendOffString :
"P3049241054" "I suspect that they may be after something specific. Make sure that these crates are accounted for, their contents are of particular value to Antimatter's research efforts."
// ActiveTaskString :
