// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1034522691" "Well, you can't stop them everytime, but you did prevent them from getting enough of those weapons to be a real threat. I have a feeling that in time the Resistance might be able to reverse engineer those weapons and produce more, but that just means we can't give them the time to do it."

