// Task - P_SL1_NP_Warrant_LE_Task4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Seer0511Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1169190229" "Seer 0511"
// DetailString :
"P3669843150" "According to Cleopatra, Seer 0511 is a little loopy. She tends to vocalize a lot of the thoughts she picks up, but a directed question at her will result in a swift answer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LabClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P602433703" "Gravatech Labs"
// DetailString :
"P2808303567" "According to Seer 0511 the Resistance are currently inside Gravatech Labs. Gravatech specializes in new hovertech engine technology."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - UploadClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3444203586" "Upload a Virus?"
// DetailString :
"P3913836745" "The Resistance leader said something about uploading a virus. If they were successful that could cause a ton of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResistancePlotClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1694121389" "The Resistance Plot"
// DetailString :
"P3744826636" "It appears that the Resistance were looking to sabotage some of Gravatech's research data on their latest hovertech engine. This could have resulted in a production model that would not meet safety standards, endangering many lives."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1728292578" "Have you ever tried to talk to a seer before, hun? Frustration at its best, let me tell ya. They suck at conversation, but that's because they are staying busy with the very important task of protecting the people from subversives, so I can understand why they and can't be bothered with idle chit chat.<br><br>But it's a whole different story when part of their job is about talking to you, and that's what I need you to do. We got word that Seer 0511 has detected alarmed thoughts in her area and is requesting Powers Division backup. That means you, tiger. Go get 'em."
// SendOffString :
"P3314580089" "The seers are trained professionals. If one of them is asking specifically for Powers Division, the threat is very real."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL1_NP_Warrant_LE_Task4_Part1 
