// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2284420376" "...I just love the way Enriche tastes, don't you?<br>...We have a meeting in thirty minutes, make sure to read the report on...<br>...Kevin, do these pants make me look fat? Don't roll your eyes at me...<br>...{HeroName}, the Resistance are currently in Gravatech Labs, which is just west of our current location. The civilians inside indicate that they plan on sabotaging the facility's latest hovertech engine schematics.<br>...Mom, I don't want to log in to school today, can't I play Guardians of Praetoria online today with Jonny? We're almost level..."

